"責任者があの教官じゃありませんように…はぁ、もう祈るしかない…","nextNodeIds":[715410102]},{"nodeId":715410102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":512233474,"text":"どうしたの？","nextNodeIds":[715410103]},{"nodeId":715410103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30708,"speakerName":"明瀾","textMapHash":1126788058,"text":"#えっ！？…ああ、{NICKNAME}さんでしたか。ふぅ…","nextNodeIds":[715410104]},{"nodeId":715410104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30708,"speakerName":"明瀾","textMapHash":1259216362,"text":"教官かと思いました…今の言葉を聞かれたら、また訓練に連れていかれるところです…","nextNodeIds":[715410105,715410106]},{"nodeId":715410105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1887749858,"text":"こんな時も訓練してるの？","nextNodeIds":[715410107]},{"nodeId":715410107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30708,"speakerName":"明瀾","textMapHash":2750909106,"text":"まあ、祭りだからこそですよ。","nextNodeIds":[715410108]},{"nodeId":715410108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30708,"speakerName":"明瀾","textMapHash":2133623554,"text":"璃月港は広いですし、祭りの間は各地から観光客が集まります。","nextNodeIds":[715410109]},{"nodeId":715410109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30708,"speakerName":"明瀾","textMapHash":2347929042,"text":"街の秩序を保ち、皆さんの安全を守るために、千岩軍は街中だけでなく野外にも機動隊の拠点を設けました。","nextNodeIds":[715410110]},{"nodeId":715410110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30708,"speakerName":"明瀾","textMapHash":2923153498,"text":"機動隊というのは——そうですね…あちこち回りながら、人々を助ける部隊だと思っていただければ。","nextNodeIds":[715410111]},{"nodeId":715410111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30708,"speakerName":"明瀾","textMapHash":797075978,"text":"困ったときは、その辺にいる機動隊に助けを求めれば、協力が得られるというわけです。","nextNodeIds":[715410112]},{"nodeId":715410112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30708,"speakerName":"明瀾","textMapHash":3633287138,"text":"危険に遭遇した時や、ものを失くした時、迷子になった時なんかにも、お助けします。","nextNodeIds":[715410113]},{"nodeId":715410113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30708,"speakerName":"明瀾","textMapHash":1812077314,"text":"ただ…璃月港全土に配備するには人員が足りなくて…教官は待機予定だった我々予備軍まで動員したんです。","nextNodeIds":[715410114]},{"nodeId":715410114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30708,"speakerName":"明瀾","textMapHash":4141136114,"text":"私たちは入隊したばかりで、訓練期間もさほど長くありません。その埋め合わせに、教官は演武会を開いて鍛えさせようとしているんです。","nextNodeIds":[715410115]},{"nodeId":715410115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30708,"speakerName":"明瀾","textMapHash":3976488234,"text":"教官はとても厳しい方で、彼の下で訓練したことがある人は、名前を聞いただけで震えてしまうほどです…","nextNodeIds":[715410116]},{"nodeId":715410116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2333744194,"text":"その人の訓練を受けたことがあるの？","nextNodeIds":[715410117]},{"nodeId":715410117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30708,"speakerName":"明瀾","textMapHash":1150417066,"text":"ええ…まあ一応。確かに訓練の効果は抜群でしたが、思い出すたびに…足が震えて…","nextNodeIds":[715410118]},{"nodeId":715410118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30708,"speakerName":"明瀾","textMapHash":3406151346,"text":"そうだ。もしよかったら、演武会に参加してみませんか？訓練中、教官は何度もあなたの話をしていました。戦闘はもちろん、格闘も強いのだとか…","nextNodeIds":[715410119]},{"nodeId":715410119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30708,"speakerName":"明瀾","textMapHash":1728442434,"text":"あなたなら、きっと我々を上回る成績を収められると思います。","nextNodeIds":[715410120,715410122]},{"nodeId":715410120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":154019698,"text":"試してみたい！","nextNodeIds":[715410121]},{"nodeId":715410121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30708,"speakerName":"明瀾","textMapHash":3616280554,"text":"潔いですね…さすが璃月にその名を轟かせる英雄です。では、こちらにどうぞ。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":715410122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3099716810,"text":"ちょっと考えさせて…","nextNodeIds":[715410123]},{"nodeId":715410123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30708,"speakerName":"明瀾","textMapHash":3229999618,"text":"はい。参加したくなったら、気軽に声をかけてくださいね。きっと教官も大歓迎だと思います。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":715410106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4176146410,"text":"海灯祭なのに。","nextNodeIds":[715410107]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7154101,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":["30708"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7154101],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30708,"speakerName":"明瀾","count":17},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","count":6}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","BEGCMMJKCFC":[171541],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":false,"CBBBCAKOFGO":2446907302,"CHECNJEMEFE":{"30708":[1190]},"CJPLOBIFHLG":"MAINQUEST_TAG_GUIDE","CMDGLJAOFOJ":[],"EPJHBBICPCA":true,"FBEFCEJCBIK":{},"FFOAGHNMJKJ":0,"FNFALGGACGA":"","FOKHPBAGMPB":"","GBFMDJLKJBF":[],"GMENNHMBBOH":[],"HCJHEADFCAO":0,"IBEGAHMEABP":[{"<DLGBBMLABOA>k__BackingField":0,"ABDCADBLCFC":0,"AIMIPKGBAHC":"","ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","AOLKCANJCMJ":5,"BKDENCDKDEE":"","BPIIFMJLJAJ":[],"DAMGEPEMGNO":false,"DBACCKDPONG":[],"DIAFFIANKPH":false,"DKOMBMCJMMN":false,"EFBOKHEHKJM":[],"EIDINNIHMHD":false,"EKANPNMEFMG":[],"ENDBMMDPPAH":[],"FALLCBHGKON":"LOGIC_NONE","GEPGLHFDBNF":[],"GLJMLHNKKKO":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","HJFLPAICAEO":false,"HNFEAICLPLM":[],"HPPIPDNHFJG":false,"IBGGIIDBOAG":false,"IEFDIICFIJK":715410101,"ILHDCGDKKKA":"TALK_HERO_MAIN","ILHDNJDDEOP":7154101,"JGFEJPBPHGJ":[],"JNFAMBOFGHJ":false,"KINCAGMDMHH":[30708],"KJLNGKKBBOI":"TALK_MARK_NONE","KNBDEPPFNBN":0,"LCIDOOMOIPM":0,"LIJPPLJCHGI":0,"LMAPLNHKPOH":[1240,1060,1130,1150,1171,1172,1173,1230],"MBDOOOMPFCD":false,"MEGMNOELHAO":false,"MMCFFPNNDDP":false,"MOAK